        <semantic:textAnnotation id="_a34bc6b1-0734-48b2-a395-51686013d486">
            <semantic:text>This scenario illustrates asynchronous message coordination using a Receive Task.
The process remains waiting but active until the external moderation service signals completion.
It mirrors many real-world architectures — social apps, video platforms, marketplaces — where automation depends on third-party decisions.

Pro Tip:
Use the message flow between the platform and moderation service to visually show communication between pools — reinforcing the concept of collaboration diagrams.</semantic:text>
        </semantic:textAnnotation>
